---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

Astro.response.status = 404;
---

<BaseLayout
  title="找不到頁面"
  titleEn="Not found"
  description="找不到你要求的頁面。"
  descriptionEn="The requested page could not be found."
  section="找不到頁面"
  sectionEn="Not found"
>
  <section class="page-intro">
    <p class="page-kicker">404</p>
    <h1>
      這條路暫時安靜下來了。 <small lang="en">This path has gone quiet.</small>
    </h1>
    <p>頁面可能已移動，或者尚未存在。</p>
    <p class="en-subline" lang="en">
      The page may have moved, or it may not exist yet.
    </p>
    <div class="button-row">
      <a class="button button--primary" href="/"
        >返回首頁 <span lang="en">Home</span></a
      >
      <a class="button" href="/search">搜尋空間 <span lang="en">Search</span></a
      >
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
